.TH NIBWARDEN\-GUI 1 2026-11-06 "nibwarden" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nibwarden\-gui \- nibwarden's windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nibwarden\-gui
.RB [ vault | quick | settings | tray ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nibwarden\-gui
shows the vault of
.BR nibwardend (1)
on the desktop.
It starts the daemon when it is not running.
.TP
.BR vault " (the default)"
The main window: browse, search, add and edit items, Sends, the password generator,
import and export.
Signed out, it signs in (bitwarden.com, bitwarden.eu or a self\-hosted server, with a
two\-step code if the account has one) or creates an account.
.TP
.B quick
Quick access: search the vault and copy a field with the keyboard.
The settings window binds it to a key (GNOME); elsewhere, bind
.B nibwarden\-gui quick
to a key in the desktop's settings.
.TP
.B settings
The settings window.
.TP
.B tray
An icon in the system tray (StatusNotifierItem; on GNOME it needs the AppIndicator
extension).
Turning the tray on in the settings window also starts it at login.
.PP
.B nibwardend
also runs
.B nibwarden\-gui prompt
for its unlock and approval windows.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SLINT_BACKEND
.B winit\-software
draws without OpenGL.
Without OpenGL nibwarden\-gui switches to it by itself.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nibwarden (1),
.BR nibwardend (1)
